<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.8500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 75.8000 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 3		  July 2</p>
<p> High			     75.9200		 75.9020</p>
<p> Low				75.8500		 75.7602</p>
<p> Open			     75.8800		 75.8000</p>
<p> Close			    75.8500		 75.8000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  3.095		   5.905</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
